  "content": "<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_8159429e-ca19-436c-b96d-9be266ff6d9f.png\" alt=\"更好的幻想\" width=\"808\" height=\"335\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_17d612e5-257c-4d36-9008-0ba57597ed5d.png\" alt=\"概览\" width=\"850\" height=\"150\"></strong></p><h4>更好的幻想旨在通过添加新的魔法机制、Boss、结构和生物群系，创造一个原版增强型的中世纪幻想世界。同时加入了选择出身起源的选项，提供各种幻想种族选择，帮助打造独特的游戏体验。</h4><h4>本整合包中精心挑选的模组，旨在在Minecraft中营造幻想氛围，同时避免功能重叠或不一致。我希望创建一个中等规模的幻想整合包，目标是不让玩家感到过于杂乱，让玩家能够深入探索每个模组，同时保持足够的多样性，让每位玩家都能享受其中。</h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><h4><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_ec6950ec-aba5-4bec-bdf4-470e2ab23497.png\" alt=\"特色\" width=\"850\" height=\"150\"></h4><h4>&nbsp;</h4><p>✨ 出身系统，打造独特游戏体验（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-origins-revival\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">中世纪起源复兴</a>）</p><p>✨ 全新维度（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">以太</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更深更暗</a>）</p><p>✨ 重制主世界与下界生物群系（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystics-biomes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘生物群系</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tectonic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">构造变动</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地植亲和</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/luminous-nether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">光耀下界</a>）</p><p>✨ 完整末地重制（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stellarity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁星终末</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endremastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">末地重制</a>）</p><p>✨ 全新生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythic-mounts-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神话坐骑</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">龙骑士传承</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自然主义</a>）</p><p>⚔️ RPG元素（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/auto-leveling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自动等级</a>）</p><p>⚔️ 新护甲与效果（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trimseffects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">纹饰效果</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-armors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式护甲</a>）</p><p>⚔️ 新Boss、地下城与结构（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">大毁灭Boss</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-now-loading\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地下城加载中 2%</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-seven-seas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">当遗迹崛起 - 七海</a>）</p><p>⚔️ 魔法机制（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">铁之咒语与法术书</a>）</p><p>📜 100+ 任务</p><p>📜 任务商店，可花费任务赚取的金币</p><p>📌 生活质量功能（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精制背包</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bonfires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">篝火</a>）</p><p>📌 注重性能设计（可选光影）</p><p>👑 100+ 模组</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_c18620d1-9e30-4f8a-adb1-ff9f869c4007.png\" alt=\"图片\" width=\"850\" height=\"150\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_58e4ae1e-c168-4631-868d-4e29c4c7c0cc.png\" alt=\"传奇生物\" width=\"845\" height=\"475\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_b7564036-174c-4eef-8baf-f931356a9b38.png\" alt=\"虚空之花\" width=\"845\" height=\"475\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_77359753-ad72-4a1a-ac80-706e710c0dcc.png\" alt=\"光耀下界\" width=\"845\" height=\"475\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_23757c5e-cc5f-483b-b8ab-e053526fc701.png\" alt=\"光耀下界\" width=\"845\" height=\"475\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_48ba35eb-63d1-4b05-b79d-85f9bd1045cd.png\" alt=\"中世纪建筑\" width=\"845\" height=\"436\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_0d409873-880e-4b19-ac2f-719e335a3cec.png\" alt=\"北欧维京建筑\" width=\"845\" height=\"472\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ABHWJj7w9W\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172765/description_00780d7c-41b4-4dbe-a8d4-4242310492bd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"150\"></a></p><p>在此加入官方Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/ABHWJj7w9W\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> https://discord.gg/ABHWJj7w9W</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>已知问题</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>与Embeddium不兼容</li>\n<li>与Optifine不兼容</li>\n<li>请勿更新模组，否则整合包将无法运行</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
